From: Andy <andylee77@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:09:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 19/22] cameras: Jennov JL12D2 / UVision MCL12D2
 (mcl12d2_ssc377d_imx335, PTZ)

SSC377D + IMX335, 2592x1944 + 1280x960 (native 4:3), ~13.5x optical zoom
(sold as 20x): 128 MB DDR with the OEM MMA heap, the sensor MIPI settings
from the OEM device tree, lensd AF and PTZ, IR-cut through the lens head,
microSD. It boots under the stock OEM U-Boot and flash layout, with the
U-Boot env kept in a file. The board wiring it shares with the YMF46D (FUART,
sensor MIPI and I2C, microSD) is one include, infinity6c-ssc377d-anjvision.dtsi;
its .dts adds the model string and the lights. The RAPTOR_* keys are in
raptor.config; the tuning is the SDK's IMX335 one.
